---
<Base title="Separating or divorcing: where to start in Morgantown and Mon County" description="Steps for people separating or divorcing in Monongalia County, WV, in order: free legal help and state court forms, bills, SNAP, Medicaid and health coverage, then records, a new place, voter registration and taxes.">
  <h1>I'm separating or divorcing</h1>
  <p class="lede">Here are steps to take when a marriage or partnership ends, in the order they often come up. Start with free legal help. Each link goes to one of our pages with local phone numbers and where we found them.</p>
  <GroupStart sections={sections} />
</Base>
